{"id":"parecido","lemma":"parecido","pos":"adj","rank":1364,"glosses":["similar"],"ipa":"/paɾeˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"parecida","masculinePlural":"parecidos","femininePlural":"parecidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-parecido.wav","examples":[{"text":"No veo parecido alguno.","en":"I don't see any resemblance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804345"},{"text":"Mary es una mujer bien parecida.","en":"Mary is a good-looking woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306333"},{"text":"Los dos hermanos son muy parecidos.","en":"The two brothers are very much alike.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538034"},{"text":"Al teléfono, sus voces suenan parecidas.","en":"Their voices sound similar over the phone."},{"text":"Sabe muy parecido al pollo.","en":"It tastes a lot like chicken.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586603"}]}